obvious when you think about it.

491
00:28:48,700 --> 00:28:54,440
If a man can go anywhere undetected, there's
one thing he's going to go looking for.

492
00:28:55,460 --> 00:28:56,860
He's so lucky, Zoro.

493
00:28:56,980 --> 00:28:59,540
Why can't I be dead like he is? Really?

494
00:29:06,420 --> 00:29:09,244
Well, it's about time we
got this show underway.

495
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:14,557
Do you want some of us to stay and protect
the palace while you're gone, Boss Heart?

496
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:15,470
No need.

497
00:29:15,553 --> 00:29:16,797
What don't you remember?

498
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:20,017
No one else can get
through the palace gate.

499
00:29:20,100 --> 00:29:22,377
We'll Station a handful
of men here to make

500
00:29:22,460 --> 00:29:24,517
sure someone's around to
open it when I Return.

501
00:29:24,600 --> 00:29:27,037
After all, you can't
lock out the new king.

502
00:29:27,120 --> 00:29:30,937
More like nonsense.

503
00:29:31,020 --> 00:29:36,337
You will Never be respected as
king if you rule through violence.

504
00:29:36,420 --> 00:29:39,317
Is that really what you?

505
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,677
I don't want your last words to be.

506
00:29:40,760 --> 00:29:42,819
I'd have gone for something strong.

507
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:44,710
Ah.

508
00:29:45,700 --> 00:29:47,320
My scar, it's burning.

509
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:52,092
I can't believe that the stupid human
swordsman actually managed to cut me.

510
00:29:52,180 --> 00:29:53,415
Ah, it's wearing off.

511
00:29:53,560 --> 00:29:56,220
Hey, it's time for my next dose. Right.

512
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:09,100
Now I feel as good as new.

513
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:11,917
Isn't the dangerous
taking that much at once?

514
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:14,060
I thought so. Hey, Captain.

515
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:17,437
What do we do with the three
Straw Hats we captured?

516
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,350
Nothing.

517
00:30:18,433 --> 00:30:19,376
They're just humans.

518
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,487
They'll drown if left alone.

519
00:30:21,660 --> 00:30:22,957
And the palace is secure,

520
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:26,687
so no one will be able to rescue
them regardless of who comes.

521
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,317
Forget them. Now,

522
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:30,317
what's the current status
of the residents from

523
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:32,617
the Fishman district
that we recruited today?

524
00:30:32,700 --> 00:30:34,112
They're doing just fine.

525
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:38,056
In fact, they should be
making their move as we speak.

526
00:30:40,300 --> 00:30:41,157
That's good.

527
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:43,897
Pretty soon they'll be out of the slums.

528
00:30:43,980 --> 00:30:47,457
Seeing as once all of the
traders have left or been killed,

529
00:30:47,540 --> 00:30:50,680
there'll be plenty of
houses on the market.

530
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:59,100
Then our country will finally be united
in its hatred for the pathetic human race.

531
00:31:02,880 --> 00:31:04,557
I think I found it, guys.

532
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:06,257
A bright ray of hope.

533
00:31:06,340 --> 00:31:10,197
Listen, those fishermen we were
dealing with earlier have left,

534
00:31:10,280 --> 00:31:11,977
so the palace is completely empty.

535
00:31:12,060 --> 00:31:15,157
Or rather, it would be if they
hadn't left Papagu behind.

536
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,357
That's awesome, Brook.

537
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:19,977
Now we just need to ask Papagu to find
the keys to get us out of these chains.

538
00:31:20,060 --> 00:31:22,737
I guess we need the one
to unlock this cage too.

539
00:31:22,820 --> 00:31:23,817
Don't be an idiot.

540
00:31:23,900 --> 00:31:26,457
Just find one of my swords.

541
00:31:26,540 --> 00:31:28,537
That's all we really need to escape.

542
00:31:28,620 --> 00:31:31,857
I'll cut anything in my way. Yeah.

543
00:31:31,940 --> 00:31:33,764
That's all you ever want to do.

544
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:57,020
I need your help!

545
00:31:57,460 --> 00:31:58,780
Find the keys, please!

546
00:31:59,520 --> 00:32:02,680
No, wait! The sword! Yeah,
yeah! Go find the sword!

547
00:32:03,020 --> 00:32:03,980
Go away!

548
00:32:04,120 --> 00:32:05,917
I don't know what you're talking about!

549
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:08,120
What are you doing? That's not me!

550
00:32:11,800 --> 00:32:12,700
Think, Luffy.

551
00:32:14,620 --> 00:32:16,637
Have you considered
what will happen if you

552
00:32:16,720 --> 00:32:19,249
resort to violence
while on Fishman Island?

553
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:23,357
Every time my people have tried to reach
out and open their hearts to humans,

554
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:26,997
They have been met with nothing
but disappointment and prejudice.

555
00:32:27,080 --> 00:32:28,845
Humans like to make us suffer.

556
00:32:29,260 --> 00:32:30,436
Humans hate fishmen.

557
00:32:30,600 --> 00:32:33,160
They look down on us. Don't you see?

558
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:35,797
This is what our citizens
have come to believe because

559
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:39,056
of the horrible things that
have happened in our past.

560
00:32:39,660 --> 00:32:42,180
And Arlong is a perfect example.

561
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:45,437
The people here believe that
the humans hunted him when

562
00:32:45,520 --> 00:32:48,920
he went to the surface solely
because he was a fishman.

563
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:52,980
And now you, the people who
suppressed Arlong are here.

564
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:56,793
What will the islanders think
if you crush Heart as well?

565
00:32:57,140 --> 00:33:01,375
Misguided though he may be, Horty's
aim is to fight against persecution.

566
00:33:01,500 --> 00:33:04,794
So even if it saves us from
this crisis in the long run?

567
00:33:04,900 --> 00:33:07,437
If they see a group of
humans attacking him,

568
00:33:07,520 --> 00:33:11,755
it will only solidify the idea that
things will never change between us.

569
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:30,217
Oh well that's too bad you're crazy
if you think we won't rescue our crew?

570
00:33:30,300 --> 00:33:34,920
And unless we do something soon Horty's
going to take over the whole island!

571
00:33:35,900 --> 00:33:39,959
And that's a problem because we have
a lot of friends that live here.

572
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:46,317
Like Hachi yeah you've kept pretty
quiet about who banged you up so bad.

573
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:49,997
But now that I think about
it you mentioned before that

574
00:33:50,080 --> 00:33:53,337
Heart attacks any fish man
that sympathizes with humans

575
00:33:53,420 --> 00:33:59,897
so i guess the reason you're
in that sorry state is because

576
00:33:59,980 --> 00:34:06,517
you spoke up for us right
why is that true already did

577
00:34:06,600 --> 00:34:13,297
this to you i can't say jimbae
with all that in mind i'm

578
00:34:13,380 --> 00:34:16,217
pretty sure luffy wants to
fight so bad because this is

579
00:34:16,300 --> 00:34:19,277
your home too we won't be
able to leave the island like

580
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:23,900
this we can't turn a blind
eye there's too much at stake

581
00:34:37,680 --> 00:34:39,400
we're taking a stand.

582
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:51,202
It's the mermaid paradise
I've always dreamed of!

583
00:35:03,020 --> 00:35:05,040
Get out of my way, Team Bay.

584
00:35:05,300 --> 00:35:07,476
I won't let you keep me here anymore.

585
00:35:07,560 --> 00:35:08,840
Let me handle it.

586
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:10,340
You stay put.

587
00:35:16,120 --> 00:35:17,400
Shut up!

588
00:35:17,940 --> 00:35:18,770
Stop!

589
00:35:18,853 --> 00:35:21,117
Sanji said all that cool stuff
and you still want to fight?

590
00:35:21,200 --> 00:35:24,820
If that is what it takes to
make you listen to me, yes!

591
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:26,800
What did you say?

592
00:35:27,260 --> 00:35:28,640
Ugh, knock it off.
